-- An adaptive octree with leaf cells containing corner values and bounds [S1, unofficial].
-- An implicit function $f(\mathbf{x})$ and an `iso_value` [S1, unofficial].
-- `max_depth`: The maximum depth of the octree [S1, unofficial].
-- `bisection_iters`: Number of bisection iterations (typically 10) [S1, unofficial].
+- An adaptive octree containing leaf cells, each with corner values of an implicit function $f(x)$ and bounds.
+- The `iso_value` defining the isosurface.
+- The `max_depth` of the octree.
+- The implicit function evaluator (and optionally its gradient).
 
 **Outputs:**
