-  - `pos`: The 3D intersection point $[f64; 3]$ [S1, unofficial].
-  - `normal`: The normalized surface normal $[f64; 3]$ [S1, unofficial].
-  - `t`: The parameter along the edge $[0, 1]$ [S1, unofficial].
+- A list of `HermitePoint` structures, each containing the 3D position of the intersection, the surface normal, and the parameter $t$ along the edge.
 
